6. DEFECT FOUND IN THIS WINDOW'S OWN GATE
   Running "python tools/face_pair_receipt.py --check" made the lobby producer
   read that flag from sys.argv and switch to its verify-the-landed-pages mode,
   so it wrote nothing and the receipt reported FileNotFoundError against the
   producer. render() now hands each producer only its own path and the two
   output paths.

